## Tarot Reading Dataset

The generated reading corpus under `public/arcana/data/*.json` is derived from
the `barissglc/tarot` dataset on Hugging Face. The dataset's license was not
explicitly identified at the time of generation.

- Regeneration script: `scripts/pull_hf_tarot.py` (reads
  `public/tarot_readings.parquet` when present)
- Runtime usage: The browser only fetches the static committed JSON files
- Before public distribution: confirm the dataset license or replace the
  generated content with original reflections

